 \"geography_columns\" isn't a table, its a **view**, and yet its included in the SQL statement.\n\n![views](https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/1150267/7964357/3c91ec86-0a0f-11e5-9770-934c0f9b1480.PNG)\n(all of the views are in the sql)\n\nHere's the stack trace:\n\n```\nStack trace:\n#0 /vagrant/src/yii2-app/vendor/yiisoft/yii2/db/Command.php(779): yii\\db\\Schema->convertException(Object(PDOException), 'ALTER TABLE \"pu...')\n#1 /vagrant/src/yii2-app/vendor/yiisoft/yii2/test/InitDbFixture.php(94): yii\\db\\Command->execute()\n#2 /vagrant/src/yii2-app/vendor/yiisoft/yii2/test/InitDbFixture.php(76): yii\\test\\InitDbFixture->checkIntegrity(false)\n#3 /vagrant/src/yii2-app/vendor/yiisoft/yii2/test/FixtureTrait.php(114): yii\\test\\InitDbFixture->beforeUnload()\n#4 /vagrant/src/yii2-app/vendor/yiisoft/yii2/console/controllers/FixtureController.php(147): yii\\console\\controllers\\FixtureController->unloadFixtures(Array)\n#5 [internal function]: yii\\console\\controllers\\FixtureController->actionLoad('*')\n#6 /vagrant/src/yii2-app/vendor/yiisoft/yii2/base/InlineAction.php(55): call_user_func_array(Array, Array)\n#7 /vagrant/src/yii2-app/vendor/yiisoft/yii2/base/Controller.php(151): yii\\base\\InlineAction->runWithParams(Array)\n#8 /vagrant/src/yii2-app/vendor/yiisoft/yii2/console/Controller.php(91): yii\\base\\Controller->runAction('load', Array)\n#9 /vagrant/src/yii2-app/vendor/yiisoft/yii2/base/Module.php(455): yii\\console\\Controller->runAction('load', Array)\n#10 /vagrant/src/yii2-app/vendor/yiisoft/yii2/console/Application.php(161): yii\\base\\Module->runAction('fixture/load', Array)\n#11 /vagrant/src/yii2-app/vendor/yiisoft/yii2/console/Application.php(137): yii\\console\\Application->runAction('fixture/load', Array)\n#12 /vagrant/src/yii2-app/vendor/yiisoft/yii2/base/Application.php(375): yii\\console\\Application->handleRequest(Object(yii\\console\\Request))\n#13 /vagrant/src/yii2-app/yii(23): yii\\base\\Application->run()\n#14 {main}\n```\n","closed_